<mxCell id="u159" value="&lt;b&gt;Answer:&lt;/b&gt; Adds (0,4) 13, (1,4) 16, (1,3) 13, (2,3) 15 and returns (2, 3). Never adds (0,1), (0,2), (0,3), (1,2), (2,4), (3,4) — each rejected end had its best partner already. O(n), O(1)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="370" width="820" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
